## Command

```shell
biome format --write base.scss overrides.scss
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "formatter": { "expand": "never" },
  "overrides": [
    {
      "includes": ["overrides.scss"],
      "css": { "formatter": { "expand": "always" } }
    }
  ]
}
```

## `base.scss`

```scss
$m: (a: 1, b: 2);

```

## `overrides.scss`

```scss
$m: (
	a: 1,
	b: 2,
);

```

# Emitted Messages

```block
Formatted 2 files in <TIME>. Fixed 2 files.
```
